# K&R style for C files: attached braces, function braces on their own line
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Language: Cpp
BreakBeforeBraces: Linux
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 80
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
SortIncludes: Never
